WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,300
I want to ask

2
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:03,300
Are there any clues about clearing this instance?

3
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:06,300
Some current information is on the bulletin board.

4
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:07,300
you can go and have a look

5
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:10,390
1. The 30-day customs clearance conditions are not difficult

6
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:13,390
A one-star wooden house loses an average of 5%-10% of its durability every day.

7
00:00:13,390 --> 00:00:15,390
Calculated based on maximum 10%

8
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:17,390
Approximately 30% of the durability is lost in 30 days

9
00:00:17,390 --> 00:00:19,390
So only 210 units of wood are needed

10
00:00:19,390 --> 00:00:21,390
You can live in a wooden house for 30 days

11
00:00:21,390 --> 00:00:22,390
This is the lowest way to pass

12
00:00:22,390 --> 00:00:26,390
2. Superimposed on the minimum conditions is the number of hunting hounds

13
00:00:26,390 --> 00:00:30,390
The more hounds kill, the higher the score and the richer the reward.

14
00:00:30,390 --> 00:00:32,390
3. Meat balls on the church

15
00:00:32,390 --> 00:00:34,390
It is speculated to be the final BOSS

16
00:00:34,390 --> 00:00:35,390
Don't even think about getting close

17
00:00:35,390 --> 00:00:37,390
That red face is in a protective posture

18
00:00:37,390 --> 00:00:38,390
Will not let creatures get close

19
00:00:38,390 --> 00:00:41,390
Creatures dragged in will provide nutrients to the meat ball.

20
00:00:41,390 --> 00:00:42,390
Wait until the meat ball has completely stopped melting

21
00:00:42,390 --> 00:00:44,390
Only humans can approach the church
